      "img": "systems/modern20/assets/icons/lorc/aura.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>Gnomes gain the bonus feat Archaic Weapons Proficiency. They may treat gnome hooked hammers as archaic weapons instead of exotic weapons.</p><p>Gnomes with Charisma scores of 10 or higher gain the bonus feat Magical Heritage.</p>",
